Package: bt-tether-lcd
Version: 0.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Uchida <uchida@local>
Depends: python3, python3-dbus, python3-gi, python3-pil, python3-numpy
Description: Bluetooth PAN tethering panel for CardputerZero APPLaunch
 Connects the CardputerZero to an iPhone's Personal Hotspot over
 Bluetooth PAN (NAP), talking to BlueZ directly over D-Bus
 (NetworkManager is polkit-gated on this system). Shows pairing
 and connection state on the built-in LCD (fb0), confirms pairing
 passkeys with the device keys, and connects/disconnects with
 Enter. Exiting the app leaves the PAN connection up.
